Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一台云上的全新电脑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's a brand-new computer in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:05.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是我们的，有 root 权限，也就是完整的管理员权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's ours, and we have root, full administrator rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:09.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们让 pip 装两个 Python 包，pip 说不行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We ask pip for two Python packages, and pip says no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:14.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条命令不是 README 里的，是我们大多数人最先会敲的那条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This command isn't from the README; it's the one most of us would type first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报错说这个环境是 externally managed（由外部管理）\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The error says the environment is externally managed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还建议用虚拟环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and suggests a virtual environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看完这个视频，报错的每一行你都会看懂\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}By the end of this video, every line of it will make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:28.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天这节课，“虚拟”这个词会出现两次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today's lecture uses the word virtual twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:32.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虚拟机，就是一整台你租来、用完就扔的电脑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A virtual machine is a whole computer you rent and throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:37.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虚拟环境，就是给一个项目专用的一套 Python 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A virtual environment is a private set of Python packages for one project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:39.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且，一个会装在另一个里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And one will live inside the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:42.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个教程叫 simple-translate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:46.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它用四种方式跑同一个小应用，每一种都去掉一类隐患\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial, simple-translate, runs one small app four ways, each removing a kind of fragility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天我们爬前两级\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today we climb the first two rungs:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:55.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先在云端 VM 上手动安装，再换一台同样配置的全新 VM，改用 uv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a manual install on a cloud VM, then a fresh VM of the same kind, with uv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:57.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 留到下节课\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker comes next lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想跟着做的话，把 README 打开，放在视频旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To follow along, open the README beside this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:03.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,左上角的进度条显示 README 的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker, top left, shows the README step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码面板会标出文件和行号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Code panels show the file and line numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到黄色的“轮到你了”标签，就暂停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When the yellow your-turn tag appears,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:12.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你自己的 VM 上跑这条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and run the command on your own VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:16.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,灰色的“额外”标签表示这条命令 README 里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A grey extra tag marks a command that isn't in the README;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的命令都是安全的，也一起跑吧\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}extras are safe, so run them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:23.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令也都在学习指南里，在 MLOps Learning 这个 repo 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command is also in the study guide, in the MLOps Learning repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:25.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开始前先做完 Tutorial 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you start, finish Tutorial 0,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:29.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样你就有一个 Google Cloud 项目，结算也开好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so you have a Google Cloud project with billing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:33.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天不用服务账号，也不用密钥，有个浏览器就行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No service account or keys today; all you need is a browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:37.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,装东西之前，先看看要装的是什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before we install anything, let's see what we're installing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:42.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上打开 cli.py，待会儿你会把它 clone 到 VM 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open cli.py on GitHub; you'll clone it onto your VM soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:47.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前两个 import，argparse 和 asyncio，是 Python 自带的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first two imports, argparse and asyncio, come with Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:50.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后两个，art 和 googletrans，就不是了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next two, art and googletrans, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:51.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们总得从某个地方来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They have to come from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.27,0:01:55.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这整节课，讲的就是它们从哪儿来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This whole lecture is about where they come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:59.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 main 函数先打印一个横幅，用 ASCII 字符画写着 AC215\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The main function prints a banner that says AC215 in ASCII art,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:03.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是解析好的参数，最后是要翻译的文本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then the parsed arguments, then the text to translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:08.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果用 -f 传一个文件，文本就改从那个文件里读\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you pass a file with -f, the text comes from that file instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:13.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最下面，argparse 定义了四个选项，各有默认值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At the bottom, argparse defines four options, and each one has a default:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:18.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文本是 I love cheese，源语言是英语，目标语言是意大利语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the text I love cheese, source language English, destination Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:21.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以不带任何选项运行 cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So running cli.py with no options
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:24.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就会把 I love cheese 翻译成意大利语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}translates I love cheese into Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:27.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一行启动事件循环并运行 main\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last line starts an event loop and runs main,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:31.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 googletrans 4 是异步的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because googletrans version 4 is asynchronous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:34.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 main 里，一个 Translator 把你的文本发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside main, a Translator sends your text off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只用一次 await 调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with one awaited call.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.07,0:02:39.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次调用就是一个 HTTPS 请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That call is a single HTTPS request
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:43.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 VM 发到 translate.googleapis.com\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from the VM to translate.googleapis.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:47.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是 Google 非官方的翻译接口\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's Google's unofficial translate endpoint:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,免费，不用 API key，也不做任何保证\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}free, no API key, no promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:54.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,返回来一小段 JSON，第 39 行把译文打印出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A little JSON comes back, and line 39 prints the translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:59.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 25 行有个细节以后会用到：raise_exception=True\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One detail on line 25 matters later: raise_exception=True.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:03.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有它的话，Google 一旦返回错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without it, when Google answers with an error,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:06.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,googletrans 就把错误藏起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}googletrans hides it and hands your own input back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:08.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把你的原文当成译文交回来，看上去一切正常\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as the translation, so nothing looks wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有了它，失败就会变成一条你能看懂的报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With it, a failure becomes an error you can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:15.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 32 到 37 行会接住那次调用的任何错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 32 to 37 catch any error from that call
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:19.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再包装成一条更友好的消息，说是网络的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and wrap it in a friendlier message about the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:21.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记住这几行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember these lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:23.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,几分钟后，它们就会误导我们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a few minutes, they'll fool us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:27.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这个应用很小：参数进去，一次网络请求，一行输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the app is small: arguments in, one web request, one line out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它需要的，是两个第三方包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What it needs is two third-party packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们去弄一台电脑，给它们安个家\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Let's get a computer, and find them a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:37.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虚拟机就是一台真实服务器切出来的一片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A virtual machine is a slice of a real server
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Google 的某个数据中心里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in one of Google's data centers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:42.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一种软件叫 hypervisor（虚拟机监控器）\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Software called a hypervisor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把这台机器切成一片一片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}carves the machine into slices.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:48.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一片都从这台服务器分到虚拟 CPU 和内存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each slice gets virtual CPUs and memory from that server,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:52.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 Google 的存储网络分到一块磁盘，还有自己的操作系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a disk from Google's storage network, and its own operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:54.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中一片会是你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One of them will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:59.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在控制台里，先确认选中的是你在 Tutorial 0 建的项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the console, check that your Tutorial 0 project is selected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打开 Compute Engine，再进 VM instances\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then open Compute Engine, then VM instances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:07.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次进去，它可能会让你启用 Compute Engine API\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first time, it may ask you to enable the Compute Engine API;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,点 Enable，再等它一分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}click enable and give it a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:11.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后点 Create instance\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then click Create instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:15.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 没给任何设置，这里给一套合理的选择\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README gives no settings, so here are sensible ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名称，比如 ac215-l01\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A name, like ac215-l01.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:22.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,区域和可用区，就是这台机器实际放在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A region and zone: where the machine physically lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:27.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,机器类型决定 CPU 和内存，e2-small 就够用了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A machine type, which sets the CPUs and memory; e2-small is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:29.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,启动磁盘选 Debian 12\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a boot disk with Debian 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:33.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 Debian 13 也行，后面会看到它在哪些地方不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian 13 works too; we'll see where it changes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:37.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保留外部 IP（也就是公网 IP），它默认就是开着的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep the external IP address; it's on by default.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:40.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有它，又没做额外的网络配置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without it, and without extra network setup,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:44.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台 VM 就上不了网，这里的每次下载都会卡住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this VM can't reach the internet, and every download here would hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在，计价器开始跳了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And now the meter starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:52.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CPU 和内存在 VM 运行期间按秒计费，闲着也照样算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CPU and memory are billed by the second while the VM runs, even when it sits idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,磁盘只要还在，就一直计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The disk is billed for as long as it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:59.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,费用估算不高，但计价器自己不会停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The estimate is small, but the meter never stops on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:03.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,点 Create，等绿勾出现，再点 SSH\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Click Create, wait for the green check, then click SSH.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:07.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要是让你授权这次连接，就点 Authorize\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If it asks you to authorize the connection, click Authorize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:11.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,浏览器里会打开一个终端，已经登录到新 VM 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A terminal opens in your browser, logged in to your new VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:14.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的提示符显示 student，你的是你自己的用户名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our prompt says student; yours shows your own username.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先在这里暂停，把你的 VM 也弄到这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause here, and get your VM to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来做三个快速的额外检查，README 里都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three quick extra checks, not in the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:23.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一，我们拿到的是哪个操作系统？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, which operating system did we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:28.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打印 os-release 文件：Debian 12，代号 bookworm\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Print the os-release file: Debian 12, nicknamed bookworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二，再问一下 python3 的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Second, ask python3 for its version.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:36.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Debian 12 自带 Python 3.11.2，给操作系统自己用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian 12 ships Python 3.11.2, for the operating system itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:40.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成 Debian 13，你会看到 3.13.5\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Debian 13, you'd see 3.13.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:42.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这两个数字都记住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep both numbers in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三，which python，不带 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Third, which python, without the 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 which 命令，查一个名字会运行哪个程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The which command asks which program a name would run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:53.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,查 python，什么都没返回：Debian 有 python3，但没有 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For python, nothing comes back: Debian has python3, but no python.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:55.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记住它，第二部分要用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember this for part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.03,0:05:59.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：输入 sudo apt-get update\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: type sudo apt-get update.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.87,0:06:04.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Debian 的包管理器是 apt，sudo 让它以管理员身份运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian's package manager is apt, and sudo runs it as the administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:07.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 update 会下载软件包列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Update downloads the package catalog:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:10.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有哪些软件包，各自最新的版本是什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the list of packages that exist, and their latest versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:12.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时还什么都没装\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing is installed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Google 的 VM 上，你会看到多出几行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a Google VM, you'll see a few more lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:18.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那是 Google 自己的软件源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for Google's own package sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:19.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:23.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 README 有个提示：apt-get 和 apt 做的是同一件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README has a tip here: apt-get and apt do the same job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:27.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 apt-get 这条命令稳定、适合写进脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The apt-get command is the stable, scriptable one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:29.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用在 Dockerfile 和自动化构建里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for Dockerfiles and automated builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:33.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,短一点的 apt，手敲起来更友好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The shorter apt is friendlier for typing by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里用哪个都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Either is fine here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:37.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：sudo apt install git\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: sudo apt install git.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次 apt 是真的要装东西了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This time apt really installs things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:43.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会列出要添加的东西，然后问你：要继续吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It lists what it will add and asks, do you want to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 Y，按回车\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type Y and press enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:50.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列表因 VM 而异；如果已经有 git，apt 会直接告诉你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The list depends on your VM; if git is already there, apt says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：把 repo clone 下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: clone the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:57.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 git clone，再加上地址；地址从 README 里复制\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type git clone, then the address; copy it from the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会把整个 repo 连同历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Git copies the whole repo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:03.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制到一个新目录 simple-translate 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with its history, into a new folder, simple-translate,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:04.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在你的 home 目录下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in your home directory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步：cd simple-translate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6: cd simple-translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:11.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意看提示符：冒号后面现在显示你所在的目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Watch the prompt: after the colon, it now shows the folder you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个波浪号代表你的 home 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The wavy tilde means your home folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:16.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跟上进度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and catch up to here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查一下：用 ls 列出文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One extra check: ls lists the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面有 cli.py、README\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There's cli.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:24.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个存成文本文件的 Dockerfile\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README, a Dockerfile saved as a text file,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.51,0:07:28.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个下节课用的脚本，还有 pyproject.toml\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two scripts for next lecture, and pyproject.toml,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:30.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列着这个应用需要什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the list of what the app needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:33.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意少了什么：没有 requirements 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Notice what's missing: no requirements file,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也没有记录精确版本的 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and no lock file with exact versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.71,0:07:38.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先记住这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Hold on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 步：sudo apt install python3-pip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 7: sudo apt install python3-pip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:46.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是 Debian 自己打包的 pip，给 Debian 的 Python 用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's Debian's own packaged copy of pip, for Debian's Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.89,0:07:48.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再输入一次 Y\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Answer Y again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:53.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们这次连带装了一百多个软件包；真正的 VM 上通常会少一些\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours pulled in over a hundred packages; a real VM usually needs fewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.08,0:07:58.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查一下：问问 pip3 的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check: ask pip3 for its version.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是 pip 23.0.1，对应 Python 3.11\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's pip 23.0.1, for Python 3.11,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:06.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 /usr/lib 下面一个叫 dist-packages 的目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a folder called dist-packages under /usr/lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:11.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 user 拼作 usr：指的是系统的文件，不是你的 home 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That user is spelled usr: the system's files, not your home folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:15.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑视频开头那条命令，不带 sudo，也不带任何参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the command from the start of the video, without sudo or any flag;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它也不在 README 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it isn't in the README either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:22.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还是一样，pip 拒绝了：这个环境是 externally managed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Again, pip refuses: this environment is externally managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示说：用 apt 安装，或者建一个虚拟环境\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The hint says: install with apt, or create a virtual environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它最后一句甚至给出了绕过去的办法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its last note even names a way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:31.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要拒绝？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先想想 Python 怎么找 import 的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Picture how Python finds an import.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:37.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外的一行命令打印 sys.path 这个列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra one-liner prints the list called sys.path:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:39.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是 Python 会搜索的那些目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the folders Python searches.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它们想成一层层的架子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Think of them as shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:46.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次 import，Python 都从最上面一层往下找，拿第一个对上的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On every import, Python scans from the top shelf down, and takes the first match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最下面这层是 apt 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The bottom shelf belongs to apt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Debian 自己也在跑一些 Python 工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian itself runs Python tools
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:56.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们依赖的正是这些罐子，而且正是这些版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that depend on exactly those jars, at exactly those versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,系统 Python 是一间公用厨房，掌勺的是 apt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The system Python is a shared kitchen, and apt is the cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:03.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 externally managed 的意思\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's what externally managed means.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.56,0:09:07.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 PEP 668 就是让 pip 遵守这一点的规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}PEP 668 is the rule that makes pip respect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:10.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 8 步是 README 里的命令：sudo pip3 install\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 8 is the README's command: sudo pip3 install,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 --break-system-packages 这个参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the flag --break-system-packages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:18.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个参数绕过了保护；sudo 让 pip 以管理员身份写文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The flag overrides the guard; sudo lets pip write as administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:22.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们要了 2 个包，装了 12 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We asked for 2 packages and got 12;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:25.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你看到 requirement already satisfied\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if yours says requirement already satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说明 apt 已经装过那个包了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}apt already had that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:30.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，警告说以 root 身份运行 pip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the warning says running pip as root
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:32.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可能会和系统的包管理器冲突\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}can clash with the system's package manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们装到哪儿去了？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:38.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外的一行命令问 googletrans 装在哪儿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra one-liner asks googletrans where it lives:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:40.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 /usr/local 下面的 dist-packages 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in dist-packages under /usr/local,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:43.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,仍然是系统的，所有用户共用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}still the system's, shared by every user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:47.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看看这些架子：这一层在 apt 那层的上面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at the shelves: that shelf sits above the one apt owns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:52.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在假设，apt 之前为某个系统工具装过一个旧版的 httpx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now suppose apt had installed an older httpx for some system tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的 googletrans 需要 0.27.2 及以上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our googletrans needs 0.27.2 or newer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:10:00.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 pip 会再装一份，放在更高的那层架子上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so pip would add a second copy, on the higher shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:04.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这时 Python 会先找到这一份，把 apt 那份挡住\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Python would find that copy first and hide the one from apt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:08.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有用系统 Python 的程序都这样，不只是我们的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for every program that uses the system Python, not just ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:10.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个参数破坏的，正是这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's what the flag breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:14.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,公平地说，README 里也讲了，这里是故意用这个参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To be fair, the README says it uses the flag deliberately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:18.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,当作快速演示，下一部分就会用正规的做法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as a quick demonstration, and the next walkthrough does it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.35,0:10:26.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台 VM 上有个同学的项目，需要 httpx 0.13\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A classmate's project on this VM needs httpx 0.13,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.53,0:10:29.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而你的项目，需要的是 httpx 0.28\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and yours needs httpx 0.28.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:32.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个项目都像这样，做系统级安装\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both install system-wide, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,会怎么样？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:46.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,架子只有一层，所以只放得下一个 httpx\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There's only one shelf, so there's room for only one httpx.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:51.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后装的说了算，对所有人都一样，两个项目总有一个会坏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last install wins, for everyone, and one of the two projects breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 9 步：把它跑起来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 9: run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:11:00.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 python3 cli.py，要带 3，因为这里没有不带 3 的 python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type python3 cli.py, with the 3, since plain python doesn't exist here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:05.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你应该会看到横幅、参数、你的输入，还有输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You should see the banner, the arguments, your input, and the output:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,意大利语版的 I love cheese\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}I love cheese, in Italian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要是出来一大段红色报错，什么都别改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you get a long red error instead, don't change anything;
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,待会儿我们一起读我们录到的那段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we'll read ours together in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，试试看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后跑 README 里的另外两条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the README's other two runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:22.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 -t 指定文本，-s 指定源语言，-d 指定目标语言\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}-t gives the text, -s the source language, -d the destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:26.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 README 复制，连引号一起，暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy them from the README, quotes included, and pause to run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:29.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条返回西班牙语，另一条返回法语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One comes back in Spanish, the other in French.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:34.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说实话，我们录的时候，Google 拒绝了我们的请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now, honestly: when we recorded this, Google refused our requests,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:37.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结果跑出来这一长串红色的 traceback\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the run ended in this long red traceback.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们来读一读，这种 traceback 整门课你都会碰到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Let's read it; you'll meet tracebacks like this all course long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:43.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一个链式 traceback：两个错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is a chained traceback: two errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:47.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,中间那一行说，第一个错误直接导致了第二个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The line between them says the first one directly caused the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:52.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大多数人只看最后一行，可这里它只是外层包装\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Most people read only the last line, but here that's just the wrapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:55.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,往上翻到第一个错误：那才是原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Scroll up to the first error: that's the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:59.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因是状态码 429，也就是请求太多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cause is status code 429: too many requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:03.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 的非官方接口在对我们的机器限流\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google's unofficial endpoint was rate-limiting our machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.69,0:12:06.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对云上的机器，它经常这样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as it often does with cloud machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:09.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台 VM 上什么都没坏。最后一行的错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing on the VM was broken. The error
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:15.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是这个应用自己的外层包装，也就是 cli.py 的第 32 到 37 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the last line is the app's own wrapper, lines 32 to 37 of cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:20.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它什么都接住，再抛出一条更友好的消息，接在原来的错误后面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It catches anything, and raises a friendlier message, chained to the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:22.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么要看第一个错误？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why read the first error?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:26.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条额外的命令故意打错了：xx 不是一种语言\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This extra command has a typo: xx isn't a language.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:30.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个错误说的是：目标语言无效\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first error says invalid destination language.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:35.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但最后一行还是在怪网络，因为同一个外层包装什么都接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But the last line still blames the network, because the same wrapper catches everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:38.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是代码的小缺陷，不是你的配置有问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small flaw in the code, not in your setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:42.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有效的语言代码，在 README 最下面的一张表里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The valid codes are in a table at the bottom of the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:45.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你遇到 429，可以等一等再试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you hit a 429, wait and retry,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:48.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换个区域，或者在你的笔记本上跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}try another region, or run it on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:53.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只要走到了 Input 那一行，import 就都成功了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you got as far as the Input line, the imports worked;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:57.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一个错误是 429 的话，说不行的只是网络\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}when the first error is a 429, only the network said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:01.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10 步，也是最后一步：把 VM 删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 10, the last one: delete the VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:06.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 也说了，运行中的 VM 会一直计费，闲着也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As the README says, a running VM keeps charging, even when idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:09.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那为什么要删除，而不只是停止？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So why delete it, and not just stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.55,0:13:15.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,停止之后，CPU 和内存不再计费，但磁盘还在，所以还在计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stopping ends the billing for CPU and memory, but the disk still exists, so it keeps billing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:18.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预留的 IP 地址也一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and so would a reserved IP address.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:23.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删除会移除这台 VM，而且默认启动磁盘也一起删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deleting removes the VM, and by default its boot disk goes with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:27.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是启动磁盘的一个设置，你没改过就是开着的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's a setting on the boot disk, and it's on unless you changed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:29.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,计价器也就停了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the meter stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:32.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,选中你的实例，点 Delete，暂停视频，等它删完\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Select your instance, click Delete, and pause until it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:37.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后检查两个页面：VM instances 和 Disks 都应该是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then check two pages: VM instances and Disks should both be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:40.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,笔记本上装了 gcloud 命令行工具的话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With the gcloud tool on your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:44.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两条额外的命令也能查：gcloud compute instances list\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two extra commands do the same: gcloud compute instances list,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 gcloud compute disks list\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and gcloud compute disks list.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:49.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这两条 README 里都没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Neither is in the README.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:51.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是简单粗暴的做法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That was the quick and dirty way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.42,0:13:55.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,能用，但它改的是机器上每个程序都在用的系统 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It worked, but it changed the system Python for every program on the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:59.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分：同一个应用，换台新 VM，用干净的做法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2: the same app, on a fresh VM, the clean way.
